text.section:
A beneficial owner may inspect and copy the records identified in subsection B of this section only if:

He has been a beneficial owner of record for at least six months immediately preceding his demand or is the holder of record of at least five percent of all of the outstanding beneficial interests;


His demand is made in good faith and for a proper purpose;


He describes with reasonable particularity his purpose and the records he desires to inspect; and


The records are directly connected with his purpose.
